WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.000
别信正在说话的我。
Don't trust the me who's talking.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.800
我没事，别叫人来。
I'm fine. Don't send anyone.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:16.750
我没事，别叫人来。
I'm fine. Don't send anyone.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.700
我是 Lena。你是楼外唯一的人。
It's Lena. You're the only one outside this building.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:24.700
他们把我锁在地下二层了。
They locked me in B2.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:27.900
转播上那个？不是我。不是现在的我。
That feed? That's not me. Not now.

00:00:31.748 --> 00:00:33.748
门外有人。
Someone's at the door.

00:00:33.748 --> 00:00:38.048
别挂。告诉我怎么证明这是我。
Don't hang up. Tell me how to prove it's me.

00:00:39.006 --> 00:00:41.306
她：Lena，举两根手指，说“蓝伞”
Her: Lena, raise two fingers and say "blue umbrella"
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:41.506 --> 00:00:43.006
蓝伞。
Blue umbrella.

00:00:46.548 --> 00:00:49.848
转播里那个不是我。
That's not me on the feed.

00:00:50.348 --> 00:00:53.148
那个杯子我根本没碰过。
I never touched that cup.

00:00:57.748 --> 00:01:00.148
有人在试门。
Someone's trying the door.

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:03.890
她：Lena，别出声，贴墙听
Her: Lena, stay quiet and listen at the wall
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:05.590
嘘，我在听。
Shh. Listening.

00:01:09.932 --> 00:01:13.932
楼内广播：请注意。B2、B3 层的灭火系统测试将于午夜开始。所有人员必须撤离。
Attention. A scheduled suppression test will begin on levels B2 and B3 at midnight. All personnel must clear these levels.

00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:19.032
我被锁在这里。
I'm locked in here.

00:01:20.332 --> 00:01:23.732
午夜前我们必须出去。
We have to leave before midnight.

00:01:24.174 --> 00:01:26.474
她：Lena，直接走侧门
Her: Lena, go straight for the side door
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:01:26.674 --> 00:01:29.074
好。侧门。现在走。
Okay. Side door. Now.

00:01:42.916 --> 00:01:44.916
下面有人。
Someone's down there.

00:01:46.758 --> 00:01:49.058
她：Lena，用手电照下面
Her: Lena, shine the light down
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:49.258 --> 00:01:51.258
好。开灯。
Okay. Light on.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:59.100
楼内广播：通知。B2 层侧门将于 23:42 闭锁。
Notice. Side doors on level B2 will lock at twenty three forty two.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.600
广播：23:42，侧门将闭锁。
Announcement: 23:42, the side door will be locked.

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:09.100
什么都没有。但它停下是有原因的。
Nothing. But it stopped for a reason.

00:02:09.342 --> 00:02:11.642
她：Lena，别回头，先往下走
Her: Lena, don't turn. Go down.
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:02:11.842 --> 00:02:14.142
不回头。往下走。
Not looking back. Going down.

00:02:16.884 --> 00:02:19.284
有人打来了。是他。
Someone's calling. It's him.

00:02:19.884 --> 00:02:22.684
我是 Adrian Voss，运维负责人。你好，Lena。
I'm Adrian Voss, head of operations. Hello, Lena.

00:02:22.884 --> 00:02:25.684
转播只是故障，Vicky。
The feed is only a glitch

00:02:25.884 --> 00:02:28.684
你存了吗？请先关掉自动备份。
Did you save it? Please switch off auto-backup.

00:02:28.884 --> 00:02:31.684
他管着整栋楼。什么都别告诉他。
He runs the building. Don't tell him anything.

00:02:31.926 --> 00:02:34.226
她：Lena，什么都别说，挂断
Her: Lena, say nothing and hang up
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:02:36.926 --> 00:02:39.226
你不用听他说话。
He doesn't get to hear us.

00:02:39.468 --> 00:02:41.868
你听到了吗？
Did you hear that?

00:02:50.968 --> 00:02:54.268
那是侧门。回不去了。
That was the side door. No way back.

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.810
她：Lena，出声问下面是谁
Her: Lena, call out and ask who's there
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:59.010
你是谁在下面？
Who's down there?

00:03:08.552 --> 00:03:10.052
我是 Hollis，维修工。
Hollis. Maintenance.

00:03:11.352 --> 00:03:14.052
这边走。他看得见楼梯。
This way. He sees the stairs.

00:03:14.252 --> 00:03:16.852
Vicky，我该信他吗？
Vicky, do I trust him?

00:03:17.094 --> 00:03:19.394
她：Lena，先问他为什么在这
Her: Lena, ask why he's here first.
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:03:19.594 --> 00:03:21.894
你为什么在这里？
Why are you here?

00:03:24.636 --> 00:03:27.436
他说他一直在找我。
He says he was looking for me.

00:03:27.636 --> 00:03:29.636
不在这儿说。走。
Not here. Move.

00:03:33.636 --> 00:03:36.036
Vicky，我不认识他。
I don't know him.

00:03:39.678 --> 00:03:41.978
她：Lena，跟他走，别耽搁
Her: Lena, follow him. Don't stall.
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:03:42.178 --> 00:03:45.078
好。我跟他走。
Okay. I'm going with him.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:52.020
楼内广播：距离灭火测试还有十分钟。
Ten minutes to suppression test.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:53.520
这边。跟紧。
This way. Stay close.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.720
有焦味。为什么？
It smells burnt. Why?

00:04:02.262 --> 00:04:04.562
她：Lena，先拍下阀门和那扇门
Her: Lena, photograph the valve and that door
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:04:04.762 --> 00:04:07.062
好，先拍下来。
Okay. Filming it first.

00:04:07.262 --> 00:04:09.562
Hollis，把光拿稳。
Hollis, hold the light still.

00:04:10.604 --> 00:04:14.604
楼内广播：B2、B3 层通风已关闭。
Ventilation is now shut down on levels B2 and B3.

00:04:17.304 --> 00:04:20.804
Tom Reyes。六年前。同一个夜晚。
Tom Reyes. Six years ago. Same night.

00:04:21.004 --> 00:04:23.904
一样的。就是今晚。
It's the same. It's tonight.

00:04:24.846 --> 00:04:27.146
她：Lena，让 Hollis 马上说清楚
Her: Lena, make Hollis talk now
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:04:27.346 --> 00:04:30.246
Vicky 在听。全都告诉我们。
Vicky's listening. Tell us everything.

00:04:32.388 --> 00:04:34.788
Hollis，说。现在。
Hollis. Say it. Now.

00:04:35.388 --> 00:04:38.188
我看到了。阀门是关的。
I saw it. The valve was closed.

00:04:41.388 --> 00:04:44.188
日志后来被改了。我一直没吭声。
The log changed. I stayed quiet.

00:04:44.388 --> 00:04:47.188
那就再说一遍。大声说。
Then say it again. Out loud.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.730
她：我们现在迅速离开这里，出去再帮我们作证
Her: We need to get out of here fast. You can testify for us once we're out.
Her: 我们现在迅速离开这里，出去再帮我们作证
Her: We need to get out of here fast. You can testify for us once we're out.
（实时生成 · 5+15 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.430
Vicky，我们走，现在。
Moving. now.

00:04:54.972 --> 00:04:56.472
上去，快。
Up. Fast.

00:04:55.772 --> 00:04:59.772
楼内广播：还有一分钟。B2、B3 层的门即将封死。
One minute. Doors on levels B2 and B3 will now seal.

00:05:03.972 --> 00:05:05.472
开始了。
It's starting.

00:05:06.972 --> 00:05:09.772
别挂我电话。
Don't hang up on me.

00:05:10.014 --> 00:05:13.114
嗨，是我。虚惊一场。
Hi. It's me. False alarm.

00:05:13.314 --> 00:05:17.114
我到家了。把我发你的东西删掉。
I'm home now. Delete what I sent you.

00:05:17.314 --> 00:05:19.114
我没事。
I'm fine.

00:05:19.214 --> 00:05:20.014
我——
I'm—

00:05:20.214 --> 00:05:23.014
我没事，别叫人来。
I'm fine. Don't send anyone.